# Pairs with ReconcileDeletesOnlyDeleted. Only origin = source proves s held the
# value. A receiver-local write still on its way to s is absent from the export
# because s has not received it, and reconciling it fabricates a delete.
MODULE: ReconcileDeletesOnlyDeletedAnyOrigin
TARGET: ReconcileDeletesOnlyDeleted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the receiver pre-captures entries of any origin, so a write the source never held is reconciled as deleted
PERTURBS: BeginExport

--- FIND
              precap |-> IF Eligible(reg[r]) THEN reg[r] ELSE Absent,
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: any live entry is pre-captured.
              precap |-> IF reg[r].present /\ ~reg[r].del THEN reg[r] ELSE Absent,
--- END
